{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>76歲的李龍基去年底結束一段長達14年感情，剛過生日的他身邊再出現年輕女伴。擁有高學歷及出眾外貌的32歲前港姐鄺美淇，近日突然於社交平台上載為對方精心佈置慶生的現場畫面。這位美女以一個極具長輩緣的稱呼直接揭開雙方隱藏的深層關係。</p>\n<h2>鄺美淇精心佈置為李龍基祝壽</h2>\n<p>剛剛在11月1日迎來76歲生日的李龍基，再次將招牌螢光粉紅髮色染回頭上，以極度搶眼的造型現身私人慶生派對。從社交網限時動態公開的照片可見，現場充滿喜慶氣氛，不但掛滿粉紅色氣球，牆上更貼有紅底金字的壽字以及福如東海壽比南山對聯。最引人注目是壽星公手持代表歲數的蠟燭，刻意將7與6兩個數字左右對調，硬生生把蠟燭砌成67歲模樣，對着鏡頭展露鬼馬笑容，可見他當日心情極度興奮。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369673630922325_21270317856ae9a3e08be36.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Ix99pAcUoOAjnwZZbRdH3zKW3eDa9popIG_bIyBv2yM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369673630922325_21270317856ae9a3e08be36.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@maggieekwongg）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>前港姐一句稱呼掀玄機 鄺美淇曾被封為「翻版陳凱琳」</h2>\n<p>面對大眾對兩人關係的種種猜測，負責分享照片的32歲鄺美淇直接在貼文中寫下「Hbd uncle dragon」，並附上三個笑到喊的表情符號。根據資料顯示，這位美女畢業於加拿大知名學府毅偉商學院，曾入圍香港小姐競選三十強，美貌與智慧並重,鄺美淇係《2016年度香港小姐競選》二十強嘅佳麗，亦係《2020年度香港小姐競選》友誼小姐鄺美璇嘅家姐，曾被封為「翻版陳凱琳」。這句以長輩作尊稱的英文留言，明確界定雙方屬於世姪女與世伯關係，並非外界一開始憑空想像的浪漫戀情，女方更特別為慶生場地花盡心思，印證男方極度討人喜歡。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369673839024395_14422408166ae9a3e28d600.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"maggieekwongg_1468675771_1295668740759711598_6323553.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369673839024395_14422408166ae9a3e28d600.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@maggieekwongg）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369673884118414_5307393696ae9a3e30bceb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"maggieekwongg_1469545822_1302967254778882938_6323553.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369673884118414_5307393696ae9a3e30bceb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@maggieekwongg）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369673937557713_3127035346ae9a3e38de57.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"maisiekwong_1688876572_3142846939038039034_920923.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369673937557713_3127035346ae9a3e38de57.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>鄺美淇係《2016年度香港小姐競選》二十強嘅佳麗，亦係《2020年度香港小姐競選》友誼小姐鄺美璇嘅家姐。（圖片來源：IG@maggieekwongg）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369674100260518_5465417236ae9a3e52fa66.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"-k_nFaR9g_Sd7sQMTTB_QJR0sWIrw1sORZ6sq0WerKs.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369674100260518_5465417236ae9a3e52fa66.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@maggieekwongg）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369674272594622_21453431006ae9a3e6e1460.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"maggieekwongg_1728996873_3479400419905062837_6323553.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369674272594622_21453431006ae9a3e6e1460.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@maggieekwongg）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369674405171033_7393916666ae9a3e8385a2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"maggieekwongg_1594127840_2348036967838994397_6323553.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179369674405171033_7393916666ae9a3e8385a2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@maggieekwongg）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>李龍基結束爺孫戀後女伴不斷</h2>\n<p>回顧李龍基近年的感情生活，自從去年底與比他年輕36歲的未婚妻正式分手後，他曾強調只要一日未辦妥手續都無得傾，但同時表示若將來情況改變亦有可能重新開始。重新出發後這段單身日子裏，他身邊依然常常出現不同女性身影，早前不但與女歌手傳出緋聞，今年8月尾現身觀看《中年好聲音4》決賽時，身旁亦有一位神秘女伴全程為他捧餐兼交頭接耳。當時他澄清女方只是朋友關係，更對外宣稱「暫時未有新歡」，展現出單身生活多姿多彩。</p>\n<h2>網民熱烈討論二人互動與關係</h2>\n<p>這場由前港姐高調賀壽引發的慶生畫面，迅速在網上掀起大批網民熱烈討論。不少網民看到照片後紛紛留言表示「基哥真係老當益壯，去到邊都有後生女陪」、「uncle dragon呢個名真係好威猛」，認為他單身後依然極具異性緣。亦有網民將焦點放在搞鬼的蠟燭數字上，直指「調轉歲數真係好搞笑」、「如果唔係叫uncle仲以為又有新戀情」，網上輿論皆聚焦於這對相差44歲的忘年互動之上。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176820637092576144_10364150046964b0232de5d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"李龍基 王青霞 （圖片來源：東方新地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176820637092576144_10364150046964b0232de5d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176828364035676586_14778291266965ddf8b2e7f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"李龍基 王青霞 （圖片來源：東方新地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176828364035676586_14778291266965ddf8b2e7f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/-2024-06-19-12.18.41_69019318766725c360e852.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"李龍基 王青霞 基哥爆喊認自己係第三者（圖片來源：IG@chrisart1017）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/-2024-06-19-12.18.41_69019318766725c360e852.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>基哥爆喊認自己係第三者（圖片來源：IG@chrisart1017）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176716207570992789_16475895886954c0dc88429.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"李龍基 王青霞 李龍基首爆同日被捕真相 簽守行為兩年才獲釋（圖片來源：IG@chrisart1017）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/176716207570992789_16475895886954c0dc88429.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>李龍基首爆同日被捕真相 簽守行為兩年才獲釋（圖片來源：IG@chrisart1017）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:19.287517+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1544,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:05:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:19:03.173168+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:20:04.488412+00:00","content_hash":"fd5d6c337b86ad8e7826f16778d886d95e6a9ccc5839c93dc98a629cd670364a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}